# Keys on the FX track: F3 (1/4), A3 (1/16), C#4 (1/64), then F4 (1/4 reversed) and C#5 (1/64 reversed) on a rising
# sweep. Each held key repeats; between notes (P1 off) the sweep passes through.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 0.5
track fx1
input sweep 100 3000 0.5
param p1 0
param p2 0
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 F3 8
note 10 A3 4
note 16 61 4
note 24 F4 8
note 36 73 6
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
